Kubernetes and how

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:47.090
to do continuous deployment
to Google Container

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:48.780
Engine with Travis CI.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:49.530
MARK MANDEL: Yeah.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:49.980
It's pretty cool.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.510
