all the things.

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:52.480
I learned something new in this.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.850
I was looking through it.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.400
There's a kubectl
set image command

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.280
that lets you change images
on deployments and daemon

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.540
sets and stuff.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.832
I've done that by editing
YAML files and then applying.

00:04:02.832 --> 00:04:04.706
But it's kind of cool
that you can do it just

00:04:04.706 --> 00:04:06.000
in a single command.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:06.200
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:06.810
That is cool.

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:09.640
I didn't know, either, that
you could do that, actually.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:10.990
It's pretty fun.

