00:05:56.340 --> 00:06:00.360
It's a company that
does SaaS-managed--

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:04.050
it started out as a
SaaS-managed system

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:05.924
for on-prem infrastructure.

00:06:05.924 --> 00:06:07.590
So people would add
their hosts, and you

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.180
